      ],
      "source": "https://whitecone.navajochapters.org/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The White Cone Chapter was first certified in 1957, and its chapter house moved to milepost 28 N-06 in 1988, adding a gas station and 24‑hour convenience store.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9,
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
